            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-10T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-11T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-09T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-10T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Winds westerly 15 to 25 km/h becoming light in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 9 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 20s.</text>
